 His extensive experience is backed by a PhD in Environmental and Building Physics, more than 17 years of working with Arup as lighting, interaction designer and smart building specialist, and eight years of teaching at the Architectural Association.&nbsp;Francesco&nbsp;has recently joined Google to develop open source standards and digital tools for the built environment.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-divider stk-block-divider stk-block stk-18b5f51 is-style-bar\" data-block-id=\"18b5f51\"><style>.stk-18b5f51 hr.stk-block-divider__hr{background:#008c73 !important;border-radius:calc(1px \/ 2) !important;height:1px !important;width:100% !important;}<\/style><hr class=\"stk-block-divider__hr\"\/><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns stk-block-columns stk-block stk-499d01b\" data-block-id=\"499d01b\"><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-499d01b-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-786bbd8\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"786bbd8\"><style>@media screen and (min-width: 768px){.stk-786bbd8 {flex:var(--stk-flex-grow, 1) 1 calc(40% - var(--stk-column-gap, 0px) * 1 \/ 2 ) !important;}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-786bbd8-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-786bbd8-inner-blocks\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized is-style-rounded\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"780\" height=\"780\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/Sophie-Gavalda.jpg\" alt=\"Sophie Gavalda\" class=\"wp-image-3844 lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 780px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 780\/780;width:291px;height:291px\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/Sophie-Gavalda.jpg 780w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/Sophie-Gavalda-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/Sophie-Gavalda-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/Sophie-Gavalda-768x768.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/Sophie-Gavalda-200x200.jpg 200w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/Sophie-Gavalda-125x125.jpg 125w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 780px) 100vw, 780px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-a9fd34d\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"a9fd34d\"><style>@media screen and (min-width: 768px){.stk-a9fd34d {flex:var(--stk-flex-grow, 1) 1 calc(60% - var(--stk-column-gap, 0px) * 1 \/ 2 ) !important;}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-a9fd34d-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-a9fd34d-inner-blocks\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"color: var(--wp--preset--color--teal); font-size: 2rem; text-align: var(--stk-alignment-text-align,start); background-color: var(--bs-body-bg); font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family);\">Sophie Gavalda<\/span>   <\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-1b10752\" data-block-id=\"1b10752\"><p class=\"stk-block-text__text\"><span style=\"color: #78b338;\" class=\"stk-highlight\"><strong>CCAC Trustee<\/strong><\/span><span style=\"color: #78b338;\" class=\"stk-highlight\"><\/span><\/p><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Head Teacher of a Primary School in North London, Sophie is dedicated to transforming education and ensuring that all children are equipped with the essential skills to live fulfilling lives. As a trained Primary Teacher, she knows how vital the early years are in forging children\u2019s paths and the power of education in opening up opportunities to learn for the future. She is passionate about teaching children to find creative solutions and enabling them to be active in developing a sustainable world.&nbsp;Sophie supports CCAC with the delivery of the programme in schools through her knowledge of curriculum and child development.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-ee47818\" data-block-id=\"ee47818\"><p class=\"stk-block-text__text\"><\/p><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-divider stk-block-divider stk-block stk-d4906a5 is-style-bar\" data-block-id=\"d4906a5\"><style>.stk-d4906a5 hr.stk-block-divider__hr{background:#008c73 !important;border-radius:calc(1px \/ 2) !important;height:1px !important;width:100% !important;}<\/style><hr class=\"stk-block-divider__hr\"\/><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns stk-block-columns stk-block stk-0b30a0b\" data-block-id=\"0b30a0b\"><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-0b30a0b-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-b3eba5f\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"b3eba5f\"><style>@media screen and (min-width: 768px){.stk-b3eba5f {flex:var(--stk-flex-grow, 1) 1 calc(40% - var(--stk-column-gap, 0px) * 1 \/ 2 ) !important;}}<\/style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-b3eba5f-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-b3eba5f-inner-blocks\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized is-style-rounded\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1500\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Franck-Marcaire-in-a-square.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4484 lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1500px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1500\/1500;width:291px;height:291px\" data-srcset=\"https