 children, he combines the perspective of an engaged parent with his professional record of advancing positive change through technology. Franck specialises in growth strategies for converging sectors such as mobility, energy, and digital services, with wide experience in platforms and infrastructure. Since 2017, he has held important director-level roles in technology start-ups, building new business lines and scaling organisations. Earlier in his career, Franck was Head of Strategy at Vodafone Australia and spent his formative years at McKinsey, Morgan Stanley and IBM.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-f6a27b0\" data-block-id=\"f6a27b0\"><p class=\"stk-block-text__text\"><\/p><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>About Our team Climate Change All Change is run by a small group of passionate designers, educators and administrators who are committed to developing creative, practical responses to the climate crisis.&nbsp; They are supported by expert consultants and volunteers. Kimberly Safford CCAC Secretary and Trustee Kimberly is an Honorary Associate of The Open University, formerly [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":2625,"menu_order":4,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-2636","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Our team - Climate Change All Change<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Climate Change All Change is run by a small group of passionate designers, educators and administrators\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview: